But let's not be too harsh on Microsoft; after all, as PCWorld puts it, ""The $600 MacBook Neo is Microsoft's nightmare,"" and it needed to do something to respond to the MacBook Neo hype. But if you need to publish a dubious whitepaper to convince people that your laptops aren't terrible, well, you might have a bigger problem.";https://www.macworld.com/article/3140022/microsoft-commissioned-a-whole-macbook-neo-study-because-its-totally-not-worried.html
