06/05/2026;India Today;Apple MacBook Neo review: Intentionally provocative, thoughtfully brilliant;7,45098E+15;"Do you know why it is impossible to hate the Mac? It is because Apple doesn't give you false promises. The marketing is on point. It involves selling value directly to a prospective customer who knows almost instantly what to do with it: buy or skip. Either way, it's a sound decision for most people.

